    "detailed_description": "Navigate through increasingly difficult obstacles to defeat the alien invasion. With two unique game modes, you'll face a variety of challenges that will push your skills to the limit. Can you master the sequences and climb to the top of the leaderboards?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039780/extras/67aa4173feeaf1fe329d174971711241.avif?t=1725044908\" width=616 height=192 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><br>In Arcade Mode, you'll face unique challenges and additional obstacles. Adapt quickly to changing patterns to succeed and climb the leaderboards as you showcase your skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Mode</h2><br>In Classic Mode, you'll face a series of progressively difficult sequences that require quick reflexes and precise timing. As you advance, the sequences become faster and more complex, introducing new obstacles and patterns to master. Stay focused and aim for a high score! Survive as long as you can and achieve the highest score possible. Compete with friends and players worldwide on the leaderboards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039780/extras/e87d1b7a8a74a937370375b34d0e51f9.avif?t=1725044908\" width=616 height=424 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Navigate through increasingly difficult obstacles to defeat the alien invasion. With two unique game modes, you'll face a variety of challenges that will push your skills to the limit. Can you master the sequences and climb to the top of the leaderboards?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039780/extras/67aa4173feeaf1fe329d174971711241.avif?t=1725044908\" width=616 height=192 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><br>In Arcade Mode, you'll face unique challenges and additional obstacles. Adapt quickly to changing patterns to succeed and climb the leaderboards as you showcase your skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Mode</h2><br>In Classic Mode, you'll face a series of progressively difficult sequences that require quick reflexes and precise timing. As you advance, the sequences become faster and more complex, introducing new obstacles and patterns to master. Stay focused and aim for a high score! Survive as long as you can and achieve the highest score possible. Compete with friends and players worldwide on the leaderboards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039780/extras/e87d1b7a8a74a937370375b34d0e51f9.avif?t=1725044908\" width=616 height=424 /></span>",
